        "title": "VigorPeak– Natural Male Vitality & Performance Boost",
        "meta_descr": "VigorPeak is a dietary supplement developed to support men’s overall wellness, with an emphasis on daily energy, stamina, and vitality. It is formulated as a natural blend designed to complement a healthy lifestyle by helping the body maintain normal hormonal function and physical performance.",
        "header_custom": "<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"prosta defend, prostadefend, prosta defend supplement, prosta defend pills\">\n <meta name=\"author\" content=\"prosta defend\">\n\t\t\n <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"\" >",
