          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content8\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stylized\" name=\"stylizedCounters\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Mark\" name=\"mark\" checked condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n        <select title=\"Type\" name=\"countersType\" condition=\"stylizedCounters\">\n            <option value=\"default\" selected>Сircle Fill</option>\n            <option value=\"circle\">Circle</option>\n            <option value=\"square\">Square</option>\n        </select>\n        <input type=\"color\" name=\"iconColor\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#000000\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"counter-container col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Shape your future web project with the Mobirise app.\n                </h4>\n                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                    <ul>\n                        <li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\"><b>Supports Natural Energy Levels: </b>VigorPeak&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\">&nbsp;includes ingredients such as Tongkat Ali and Magnesium, which are commonly used to support the body’s natural energy processes. These nutrients may help reduce everyday fatigue and promote sustained energy throughout the day without relying on harsh stimulants.</span><br></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\"><b>Helps Maintain Physical Stamina:</b> Botanical extracts like Hawthorn Berry and Horny Goat Weed (Epimedium) are traditionally associated with circulation support. Healthy blood flow plays an important role in endurance, helping the body perform more efficiently during physical activity and daily movement.</span><br></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\"><b>Encourages Hormonal Balance:</b> Tribulus Terrestris is included for its traditional use in supporting male hormonal wellness. Balanced hormone levels are important for maintaining strength, metabolism, motivation, and overall vitality over time.</span><br></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\">&nbsp;<b>Supports Recovery and Cellular Health:</b>&nbsp;VigorPeak contains antioxidant-rich ingredients that help protect cells from oxidative stress caused by daily physical exertion. This support may aid recovery and help reduce feelings of tiredness following activity.</span><br></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\">&nbsp;<b>Promotes Circulatory and Heart Wellness:</b> With ingredients such as Saw Palmetto and Magnesium, the formula is designed to support healthy circulation and cardiovascular function key components of overall wellness and physical performance.</span><br></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 20.8px;\">&nbsp;<b>Supports Focus and Stress Management:</b> Certain natural compounds in VigorPeak are traditionally associated with stress support and mental clarity. By helping the body adapt to daily stress, the formula may support improved focus and a balanced state of mind. that affect quality of life.</span><br></li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_anchor": "content8-1l",
